Step 1: prefix sum = 1, need (1-2) = -1 → not in map. Add {1:1}
Step 2: prefix sum = 2, need (2-2) = 0 → 0 is in map (we initialized it). Count += 1. Add {1:1, 2:1}
Step 3: prefix sum = 3, need (3-2) = 1 → 1 is in map. Count += 1. Add {1:1, 2:1, 3:1}

Total count = 2 subarrays: [1,1] and [1,1] (the second and third positions).

